===Etymology===
1768; a borrowing from {{bor|en|frm|oriol}}, from {{der|en|fro|oriol}}, from {{der|en|la|aureolus}}, diminutive of {{m|la|aureus||golden}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈɔːriːəʊl/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈɔːriːoʊl/|lang=en}}
* {{homophones|lang=en|aureole}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of various colourful [[passerine]] [[bird]]s, the [[New World]] orioles from the family [[Icteridae]] and the [[Old World]] orioles from the family [[Oriolidae]].

